_text","block_id":"Eopq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a4a2ce6e-8011-432a-b6c4-6b9ce5353ebf","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あーこれもしかして動的に中身が書き換わるタイプですかね。空の `s:after_ftplugin()` って関数があったのが気になってた","ts":"1632309290.366200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kp4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5a9bb55-6d6e-46dc-94c9-62b479cd421b","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ftplugin設定してないユーザーには無意味","ts":"1632309248.365600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XJz2u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f7e1304-d64b-47bf-9434-1d9dbccfece3","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ftpluginの処理をhookしてゆーざーが上書きするために生成してます","ts":"1632309239.365200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2pmPh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c95310e4-7288-4782-8175-d11709ebf165","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"直します","ts":"1632309152.364300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"pray","count":1,"users":["U03C71D7H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vk5wI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ced811c0-fd1b-46f3-be3e-54d90bac5699","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"あー、確かに意味のない環境でも生成してる","ts":"1632309150.364100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vfE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc70e72f-6a9f-4565-8266-23a941e054b9","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"起動速度の最適化のためならあらゆる手段を使うという思想","ts":"1632309079.363600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4pm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21b744df-8484-48d8-a0c6-24083d0767c6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"これが何のために必要なのかよくわかりませんでした","ts":"1632309066.363000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qIr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7478253-5a0d-4023-a9c8-dfc6fc535520","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"dein.vimの利点はよけいなことしない、ではありません。","ts":"1632309050.362300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wj5F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bbb36d77-f710-4a3f-8995-1fa88b2643c9","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ftplugin設定がないなら生成する必要はないと思うのでみときます","ts":"1632309032.361600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A6m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d747e3fb-ff99-4055-92f7-bca362eea1ea","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"これはftplugin設定のマージにいるんですよね","ts":"1632309012.361000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"70cyd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd678356-5604-4d75-a176-050172907080","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"余計なことしないのが dein.vim のウリだと思っていたのだけど…","ts":"1632309001.360800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o0Osz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30fca9a5-80a1-4295-a771-f7420c2756a4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"消したい","ts":"1632308963.360100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uRr7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15099f4a-6722-4466-a772-e71ad9346a3d","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"これはそうです","ts":"1632308953.359900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fUC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc35c482-7528-49cf-98c8-50ebfeceabd2","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"そこは自分もちょっと追ってみたのですが、dein.vim が作ってました (dark power 恐るべし)","ts":"1632308887.359700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aL2oX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec858785-a6e5-4322-98e3-dbacec53336b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"今自分の環境を調べていたら、dein のキャッシュディレクトリ(rtp)に出自不明の ftplugin.vim と言うファイルが置かれているのを発見してしまった…入れているプラグインの中にはこのファイルなさそうなのだけど、どこから来たんだろうこれ…","ts":"1632308778.358600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SXceC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fbc6582b-b260-42a4-9ff1-3a1a285f42df","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ftplugin を先に有効にしておかないといけないので、最初に有効になってるなら問題なさそうにも思える…","ts":"1632308687.357400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Me"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1ecbd28-9f8a-4099-a4d8-bea4ac3f62b5","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"syntax も同様ですか?","ts":"1632308665.356900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bCYsp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b8ec434-e8fc-4158-87bf-c5513d646285","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"確かそう","ts":"1632308592.355800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FHut"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c75d0a7-f313-4f92-90ea-926fbda9f05d","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"設定としては init.vim の最初の方で無効化して、最後の方で再度有効化する感じですかね?","ts":"1632308123.355600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K+RL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fbb50838-2f95-483e-be89-75cc18930714","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"filetype plugin indent offを明示的に実行すれば無効にできたはず","ts":"1632307899.354600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cqs8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce91337e-6771-4ad0-af5e-04ce1753b24d","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"deinはそれをデフォルトで無効にしてますね","ts":"1632307797.353700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yDadz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b749410-f576-4d4b-b0d7-82e7bf6b45a8","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"なるほど。ただ、Neovim は デフォルトで `filetype plugin indent on`  なんですが、どのタイミングで実行されているかご存じですか?","ts":"1632307284.353000","edited":{"user":"UGN0T63GC","ts":"1632307382.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CPVfy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d22a9996-9d39-4f19-8a42-23e92130c536","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"おー、なるほど","ts":"1632306996.351400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xxVh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1852347-8574-4fe2-8646-b9ced7954897","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"で、これって `filetype plugin on` を実行したタイミングで FileType イベントが仕込まれるんですよね(すでにオンだと何も起きない)。\nなので `filetype plugin on` より後に `autocmd FileType * setlocal fo-=r` を書くと実はいけないだろうか? (試してないですが)","ts":"1632306836.351200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MsQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4632c7d3-4440-4a18-96f1-f9f51e1e0b88","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そもそも ftplugin は FileType イベントを契機に実行されます","ts":"1632306734.349600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WXd/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2a0c7e0-95de-4da4-abcf-f6ec0b7c85cb","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なのでFileType -\u0026gt; ftpluin -\u0026gt; BufEnterってことじゃないかな?と理解してた","ts":"1632306708.349100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nxV/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33b40289-e898-40ce-a902-b3365dce498b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"fo 設定されるの ftplugin とかじゃないのですっけ","ts":"1632306666.348600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xrxRr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7869de9a-c4c2-4eba-8002-5f5f2cc029ec","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"イベントの呼び出し順とか、まだまだ把握できてないなぁ。","ts":"1632302067.348200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"COHFO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8f851db-3ac8-476c-80c3-22dfc242a64f","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"お、BufEnter イベントで設定したらいけました。ありがとうございます。","ts":"1632302025.347600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+3UFs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7d0cdb7-dfc6-4287-8666-7b79d7d8e4f6","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"ですよねぇ。`after/ftplugin/common.vim` とか受け付けてくれると良かったんですが…。","ts":"1632301698.347100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zvS1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6d30b9e-33f0-4504-bbf3-87a7d3c5fd29","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、全ファイルタイプだとこれは無理だけど","ts":"1632301654.346200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yT2yW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f3793827-ac21-476d-8b5a-d050bbeeea20","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あとは after/ftplugin/hoge.vim に書くとかがよいらしいと .vimrc にメモがw","ts":"1632301630.345800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3SP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2b114cb-9a88-49ef-8ee1-72115fb6e83b","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"FileTypeイベント後にfoが設定されるんですよね","ts":"1632301590.345200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UGN0T63GC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pC0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c22dfb5c-99b0-4ed1-bc2b-64a85e413a78","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"BufEnterかInsertEnterあたりで仕込まないとダメだった気がします","ts":"1632301541.343900","edited":{"user":"UBQ2H65JQ","ts":"1632301555.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0k3d6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68a19091-2719-4fa9-a970-c65c70b099fc","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"質問です。全ての FileType で formatoptions から特定のフラグを削除したいのですが、どうするのがいいでしょうか?\n`autocmd FileType * setlocal fo-=r` のように FileType event を使って設定するのは(少なくともNeovim では)効果なしでした。\n(闇の力 (dein.vim) を使えば実現できることは知ってるのですが、標準機能だけでできないかと・・・)","ts":"1632301380.342800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UFbZ"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02FXDJ8BU0","text":"\u003c@U02FXDJ8BU0\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1632282440.338900","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"6716d4e4-1ab2-4d54-ac70-0b39efea7447","type":"message","user":"URH8C3NCW","text":"裏技として `call lexima#clear_rules()` をよんでから `call lexima#set_default_rules()` するときれいに初期化できます","ts":"1632280286.338600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"otxu","count":1,"users":["U03C71D7H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3pko"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bcd622f5-f0d5-45c8-be83-5682d3ad0c24","type":"message","user":"URH8C3NCW","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1632233161282200\u003e\nこれなぜだろう？\nプラグインの読み込み順が変わったとかですかね？","ts":"1632280213.337900","attachments":[{"fallback":"[September 21st, 2021 7:06 AM] thinca: lexima.vim で、以下の設定をして括弧やクォートの設定を潰しているんですが、設定を変えた覚えがないのに最近になって括弧やクォートの閉じが勝手に入力されるようになっちゃいました。同じような現象にあった人や、なにか心当たりがある人っていますか?","id":1,"author_id":"U03C71D7H","author_name":"thinca","author_subname":"thinca","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U03C71D7H","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2015-01-15/3417067010_04a676b32692fb2507e1_48.jpg","text":"lexima.vim で、以下の設定をして括弧やクォートの設定を潰しているんですが、設定を変えた覚えがないのに最近になって括弧やクォートの閉じが勝手に入力されるようになっちゃいました。同じような現象にあった人や、なにか心当たりがある人っていますか?","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #question","ts":1632233161.282200,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1632233161282200","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CJMV3MSLR/p1632233161282200"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CG6e5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dcb0f57b-5a9e-4132-9201-a38a94bd57d2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"とりあえずzinitのlazy loadを全部切って様子見てみよう・・・\nなんか心当たりある方いたら教えて頂きたいです","ts":"1632274070.337400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9jOb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"092830B2-0013-4291-89E1-64EFA914BE58","type":"message","user":"U02F0Q9C7LH","text":"ありがとうございます、コミット前にdiffみてると思った様に解釈されてないことあるので、古い情報で上書きしてないか自分で確認しなきゃいけない(SVN側で弾けない)のかなと考えてます…\nとりあえず、皆さんの意見をまとめて改善しようと思います！ありがとうございました！","ts":"1632272994.336900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b5g/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8322441-039c-42a3-90b6-4dd7e5619a7c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"zshenvとzshrcを空にしたら解決した・・・\nzinitあたりの問題・・・？","ts":"1632272307.332000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wlW1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"412493c5-3c29-4ca9-b8a0-f6ce85790f96","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"zshの問題かも・・・？","ts":"1632272156.331500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KpA3="}]},{"client_msg_id":"487c6d56-099c-42de-977a-07da14b571f5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"最近急に条件不明で（Mac起動後しばらくしばらく使っていると）Neovimが起動後Insertやコマンドラインモードに入った瞬間ハングするようになっているんですが、何か原因思いつく方いらっしゃるでしょうか\nNeovimのstableやtmux外での操作やAlacritty以外の端末を試したんですが効果がないです。\n\nMac起動後、症状が起こるまでは全てのNeovimで正常に操作ができて、症状が起きてからも正常に操作できるNeovimは引き続き操作可能です。\n一回その現象が起きてからはtmuxや端末アプリに関係なく全てのNeovimでその症状が発生します。\nVimは（そもそも `if has('nvim')` をある程度使ってるのでdiffがあるのですが）動作します。\nプラグインに関してはdeinのcacheが関係あるかもと思ったんですが、dein本体含めディレクトリごと吹っ飛ばして入れ直してもプラグインのインストール直後にハングします。\n\nリブート後しばらく問題なく動いてしまうのと、 `-u NONE` だと動くので何かの設定が邪魔してる気がするんですがプラグインいろいろ外しても特定できず・・・","ts":"1632271718.331200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rvvt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"984AB0DF-B9EB-4088-90FB-9F71B7BB813F","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"そういえばさすがにCVS使うOSSもなくなってきましたね","ts":"1632270621.324000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4ZAV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d70fad5d-047b-4c52-9801-351d63ea2d0d","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"git 使ってからは戻りたくないですが、SVNは十分よくできていたと思います(CVS比)","ts":"1632270131.323100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jWTJX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B19B092E-6110-41A3-881E-6B61F292F941","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"なに、あれは普通運用ではなかったのか…","ts":"1632269997.322400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K8nS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0aeac9f-e790-4cdb-ad63-5831767cbb15","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"え、そうかな……？","ts":"1632269889.321900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x4I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62992E53-D01D-4B51-8264-C3B5795223A4","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"普通にやると master (trunk) オンリー運用になってしまう","ts":"1632269845.321700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UpIre"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FD20EB75-2C90-488A-8F1F-C565C7D39C2D","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"てかブランチの概念からして違うというか","ts":"1632269815.321100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uJ/2M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"721C5333-D931-480E-A6E6-94CAC8FE1A5F","type":"message","user":"UKHU