s":"1632268910.314100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bbx7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c07705c7-f7ce-4dac-bf4e-e1de532af9dc","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"バージョン管理システムは運用を補完してくれるだけなので、運用ルールがないとどうにもならないですね。","ts":"1632268835.313400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":3,"users":["U81LLJ340","UFHQ7TNT0","UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OC/g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"633EE711-11A4-42AA-9A63-47A93E407FBF","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"運用次第ではあるんですけど","ts":"1632268798.312800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cbXfK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BA59D357-0F96-4663-B076-6F9DE364CC52","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"Gitでいうコミット=プッシュなので、、","ts":"1632268783.312300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WzF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89a7d5f9-f468-465e-8725-b591267ec305","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"SVN全く分からないんですけど、バージョン管理システムなのにmaster相当のところにものが入るときにレビューって通らないものなんですか？","ts":"1632268728.311400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EKc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C5BC967A-F2F8-400C-A963-3324E67272B3","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"あ、人ごとにブランチを作るのか","ts":"1632268699.310800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["UP6PA1UBE"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yy9IB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76155622-306b-4507-b679-49c4e4b5efd9","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"SVNでできる話ですよ。","ts":"1632268587.310200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jcm8f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9BA98358-06B9-4DD3-AF39-E593FAF69490","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"それはGitの話では？","ts":"1632268577.310000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PMYwR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c43a43eb-c785-4bfc-9cbc-302ebd5804a9","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"マージ前レビューを行うとか。","ts":"1632268542.309600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xNYL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8b353b5-23b1-44e7-ace1-811fa9e68237","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"コミット権限を各人のブランチに限定すれば強制性もある。","ts":"1632268508.309400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1K+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1de49cc8-b385-4215-874e-04d57975a517","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"各人はブランチで開発して、マージは有識者が担当するという運用。とか","ts":"1632268457.308800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AXLPp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86CE5E97-E574-4ACA-9FD8-6D6FBACB4470","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"暖かみのある声がけコミット","ts":"1632268403.308100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n3r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ffee5a5-0874-4079-8820-8167b76df5ae","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"複数人で編集して競合が発生したらコミットエラーになって上書きされたりはしないはずですが、過去のファイルで上書きというのは意図的に行っているということでしょうか。\n(本人は「意図してない」と言うかもしれないが、実態は何も確認せずに自分側のファイルで上書きして競合を解消したつもりになってコミットする。)","ts":"1632268380.307600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FjWO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3da4c11b-a509-407c-9725-7a4719cfd6ed","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"同じファイル複数人で編集しないようにスケジュール組めたら最高すなぁorz","ts":"1632268009.305200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rbk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e36eb03-84eb-4da4-80c4-c9bf84f68139","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"svnでも、古いファイルで、はあまりやらかした記憶がない…手順の分析もうちょっとしたい感","ts":"1632267344.303900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PG=LF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BAE65C50-723F-4253-A9F9-96D60F643509","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"git-svn を使うのはどうでしょう？\nもし、部分的にでもgitが使えるなら、開発はgit、マージしたものをCIから自動的にsvnにコミットという方法も取れます。","ts":"1632267279.302500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+cA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6584a31d-af5e-4962-a159-702bf5748328","type":"message","user":"UEB0VGD7E","text":"Gitを使うのが一番感ありますが","ts":"1632267021.298900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dXIj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a31f0f2a-abb5-4990-a475-c57d56b00584","type":"message","user":"UEB0VGD7E","text":"コミット前にアップデートはそれほど注意しなくてよかった気がします(してないとコミット時にエラーになる)\nSVNのコミットミスが頻発してた頃はコミット前のレビューで防ごうと頑張ってましたね","ts":"1632266965.298300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Igd8G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52baad1b-897c-4dd5-aac4-50de06df5d43","type":"message","user":"U02F0Q9C7LH","text":"Vimではなく、複数人でのバージョン管理についての質問です。\nSVNを使っているのですが、うっかり過去のファイルで上書きコミットを防ぐには…\n・コミット前にアップデート\n・コミット内容とリモートのdiffをとって必要なところだけコミット\n以外に対策はありそうでしょうか。(間違ってたら教えてください)\n皆さん運用ルールなど、聞かせていただけると嬉しいです。","ts":"1632266531.295400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ct+=P"}]}]
